# VSCodium Extensions
# Install with: make vscode-extensions

# Language Support
vscodevim.vim                          # Vim keybindings, so the GUI fallback keeps nvim muscle memory.
ms-python.python                       # Python language support: IntelliSense, debugging, environments.
rust-lang.rust-analyzer                # Rust language server (the same one nvim uses).
golang.go                              # Go language support.
dbaeumer.vscode-eslint                 # ESLint diagnostics for JS/TS projects that use it.
esbenp.prettier-vscode                 # Prettier formatting, matching the global prettier from the npmfile.

# Git Integration
eamodio.gitlens                        # Inline blame and history.
mhutchie.git-graph                     # Commit graph view.

# Utilities
editorconfig.editorconfig              # Honours per-project .editorconfig indentation rules.
usernamehw.errorlens                   # Shows diagnostics inline on the offending line.
streetsidesoftware.code-spell-checker  # Spell checking in code and comments.
christian-kohler.path-intellisense     # Completes file paths in strings.
yzhang.markdown-all-in-one             # Markdown shortcuts, TOC and preview.

# Themes
zhuangtongfa.material-theme            # One Dark Pro colour theme.

# Docker & Containers (if needed)
ms-azuretools.vscode-docker            # Dockerfile and compose support.

# Markdown & Documentation
davidanson.vscode-markdownlint         # markdownlint in the editor, the same linter `make verify` runs.
